  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that multimodal models with multiprofile, transformer aggregation, and weighted fusion (e.g., config_039) achieve the highest accuracy (0.7249). This experiment tests whether replacing the RNA encoder from scvi_n200 (used in config_039) with pca_n2000 (which underperforms in singleprofile setups) affects performance, isolating the RNA encoder's impact. It balances exploitation (building on the multimodal/multiprofile success) and exploration (testing a key design choice with sparse evidence)."
